+# EX-T02-WAL-01 r2 — approved scoped classifier update
+
+Human “duyệt” after Kidea13073e3 approved EX r2 for the one added pair: memcpy walIndexWriteHdr68471 to memcmp walTryBeginRead70780. Retain r1 conditions and original two pairs. No blanket SQLite exemption, instrumentation suppression, changed data oracle or product acceptance. This approval covers authoring/offline checks only; build r7 needs a new immutable execution grant.
+
+Classifier checks write8/read8, same address, exact two interceptor frames and SQLite function/line, shared header offset0 for the new pair; identity binds source/image/GCC/package inventory/flags and policy r2. Existing raw exit66/JUnit failure remain. Unknown or incomplete reports, mixed application race and missing data remain blocked.
+
+65 policy tests +34 gate tests =99 offline PASS. Five syntax/static/unchanged-source checks PASS. Offline evaluation of immutable r6 evidence verifies all46case/796assertion closures:40clean,6known-report-review-required under r2. This substitutes only the policy ID for an offline review; it is not a new runtime result and does not rewrite r6 FAIL. Original r6 controls/HTTP/release statuses stay historical.
+
+Implementation errors and fixes are retained in Kidea evidence: initial new approval test rejects before implementation; one editing escape syntax error; one mutation targeted an unrelated lower stack frame instead of the exact access frame, corrected to #2. Final negative tests actually modify the intended frame and block. No backend, C++ assertion, HTTP oracle, vendor, controls, build script or collector semantics changed.
+
+Next: review Kidea docs/R09_T02_BUILD_R7_REVIEW.md and its final-source manifest. Proposed one run≤2h/4sequential containers,2CPU/4GiB each,≤8GiB new disk/≤2GiB data,free≥100GiB,no network/download/hostports. Run dev,ASan+UBSan,TSan,release with all controls/tests; failures stop without replay. Highest automatic state remains EVIDENCE_READY_WITH_TSAN_LIMITATION_REVIEW_REQUIRED. Human reviews exact warnings and full evidence before limited acceptance. T02/R09 still open; R10 unopened.
